    "turn_text": "Well, first I hope you'll bring the same Energy and spark that he brought to the last state of the Union, which in my view was one of his best speeches in his entire public service career. I mean, it was phenomenal. And you had the diverse Democratic coalition celebrating it. I don't remember Jamal Bowman from the back seats yelling, Mr. President, that was phenomenal. So he had energized our party. And I hope he'll do the same. And then second, I think he'll I hope he offers a forward-looking vision for America. Yes, talk about some of the accomplishments, but you know what? People don't want us patting ourselves on the back. Talk about what he's going to do in a second term, about rents that are too high, about the costs of childcare, about raising wages for folks, about continuing to bring manufacturing back, offer his vision for the nation and a forward-looking second-term agenda.",
